Keyword Purpose <code>State</code> Defines a state block (the main unit of script execution) <code>Function</code> Defines a reusable function <code>returns</code> Declares the return type of a <code>Function</code> <code>Conditions</code> Section inside a <code>State</code> that checks transition/trigger conditions <code>Actions</code> Section inside a <code>State</code> that runs actions/statements <pre><code>State Patrol() {
    Conditions {
        if (playerSeen) {
            goto Chase;
        }
    }
    Actions {
        Wait(1.0);
    }
}

Function Add(Number a, Number b) returns Number {
    return a + b;
}</code></pre>

Keyword Purpose <code>goto</code> Transitions execution to another <code>State</code> <code>gosub</code> Calls another <code>State</code> as a subroutine and returns when it finishes <code>next</code> Advances to the next state <code>previous</code> Returns to the previous state <code>wait</code> Pauses/yields script execution for a <code>Number</code> of seconds (or one frame if omitted) <code>return</code> Exits a <code>Function</code> (optionally returning a value) or state subroutine <pre><code>State Intro() {
    Actions {
        Wait(2.0);
        goto MainLoop;
    }
}</code></pre>

Keyword Purpose <code>if</code> Executes a block if a condition is <code>true</code> <code>elseif</code> Fallback condition checked when the previous <code>if</code> / <code>elseif</code> was <code>false</code> <code>else</code> Fallback block when all preceding conditions were <code>false</code> <code>while</code> Repeats a block as long as a condition remains <code>true</code> <pre><code>if (health &lt;= 0) {
    goto GameOver;
} elseif (health &lt; 25) {
    lowHealth = true;
} else {
    lowHealth = false;
}

while (count &lt; 5) {
    count = count + 1;
}</code></pre>

Modifier Scope &amp; Behavior (none) Local to the current <code>State</code>, <code>Function</code>, or script block <code>Global</code> Persists across states and script scopes <code>Extern</code> Injected from job or caller parameters <code>Debug</code> Debug-only variable <pre><code>Global Character cPlayer1;
Extern Number difficulty;
Debug Bool showOverlay(false);</code></pre>
